<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria's June jobless rate eases to 14.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria's June jobless rate eases to 14.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of unemployed in Bulgaria fell to 541,599, or 14.2 percent of the workforce, in June from May, a National Labour Exchange (NLE) official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In May, the unemployed numbered 567,320, or 14.8 percent of the workforce.</p>
</text>
